                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a4817ba-f3d8-4c79-95b5-8706f4a368fc",
                        "source_entry_id": "c650c1b8-eb09-3687-abbd-10aa467e5d62",
                        "source_sense_id": "7289a738-d6a0-3611-a7ac-dee70e968c12",
                        "target_lang_word": "pacification",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pacification",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1347679f-dc6b-36d4-81f4-d3b51c285ee8",
                                        "entry_id": "af7ca2f8-6439-3323-91a9-c87c3b4ba323",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of pacifying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32a836a0-5bdb-4850-89b9-5a1171f9e9ff",
                                                "sense_id": "1347679f-dc6b-36d4-81f4-d3b51c285ee8",
                                                "text": "The Proteſtants in their Anſwer acknowledged the good-will of the Emperor their Chief, and ſhewed, that the Catholicks ahd oppreſſed them, contrary to the Pacification"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bff250ef-3080-413e-a154-9246c3ef50ad",
                                                "sense_id": "1347679f-dc6b-36d4-81f4-d3b51c285ee8",
                                                "text": "The electrification of the lines radiating from Casablanca originated with the policy of economic penetration and conciliation pursued by Marshal Lyautey for the pacification of Morocco."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2df7fab6-f83c-47fe-a62a-ae236bb315dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "c650c1b8-eb09-3687-abbd-10aa467e5d62",
                        "source_sense_id": "7289a738-d6a0-3611-a7ac-dee70e968c12",
                        "target_lang_word": "appeasement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appeasement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                        "entry_id": "5709de90-e65f-3fa0-914b-1354a89bf4a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being appeased; the policy of giving in to demands in order to preserve the peace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe08409d-c116-476c-b63f-2d3757bfd9d1",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "This decision is the end of any attempts at appeasement in our land; the end of urging us to get along with the dictators, the end of compromise with tyranny and the forces of oppression."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679374a2-b8c9-49d2-a636-954ea1f9d311",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "Senator, Saturday on television, you said that you had always thought that Quemoy and Matsu were unwise places to draw our defense line in the Far East. Would you comment further on that, and also address to this question: couldn't a pull-back from those islands be interpreted as appeasement?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315fc74e-6d6a-4fd3-8cbd-dea46a9e232b",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "What’s crucial is that the Taiwanese people preserve their individual freedom and the planet does not endure a third world war. The best way for the United States to pursue those goals is by maintaining America’s military support for Taiwan while also maintaining the “one China” framework that for more than four decades has helped keep the peace in one of the most dangerous places on earth.\nHawks will call this appeasement. So be it. Ask them how many American lives they’re willing to risk so the United States can have official diplomatic relations with Taiwan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6148eda8-3f4a-4802-8cbb-a734bcf51706",
                        "source_entry_id": "c650c1b8-eb09-3687-abbd-10aa467e5d62",
                        "source_sense_id": "7289a738-d6a0-3611-a7ac-dee70e968c12",
                        "target_lang_word": "policing operation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54fd23f2-7a58-47f7-9fda-bc460065e4d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "c650c1b8-eb09-3687-abbd-10aa467e5d62",
                        "source_sense_id": "7289a738-d6a0-3611-a7ac-dee70e968c12",
                        "target_lang_word": "pacification",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pacification",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1e7f803-2929-33a4-b4a6-80bd321ab494",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "– Ici, on ne dit pas « la guerre », on dit « la pacification », nuance! — (Pierre Lemaître, Le Grand Monde, Calmann-Lévy, 2022, page 102)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f656e8e0-6c82-33b2-9a81-b2a4afe5e0c7",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Les régimes appliqués d'un bout à l'autre de l'empire sont divers. L'Algérie, après une longue « pacification »-c'est à dire une guerre impitoyable pour briser toute résistance à l'occupation et chasser de leurs terres ceux qui y habitaient- est devenue une colonie de peuplement. — (François Reynaert, Nos ancêtres le Gaulois et autres fadaises, Chap. La colonisation, page 554, Le Livre de Poche-ISBN 978-2-253-16282-7, 2012)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03585051-397b-3d91-b741-ef6af6ee0547",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En 1957, il fallait une force de protection de 24 hommes pour 300 travailleurs, en 1960, 10 pour 500 000 travailleurs ce qui indique le degré de pacification obtenu. — (Bachaga Boualam, Les Harkis au service de la France, page 32, France-Empire, 1963)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "279bb5cb-d7d9-359b-b124-9ae2771f15bd",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Puis, très volubile, il me donna un « digest » de la pensée politique des officiers de pacification : « Nous ne partirons pas », c'était le leitmotiv. — (Henri Alleg, La Question, 1957)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d007ea3e-8206-3ff2-91fc-ec3d1cb01e54",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Toutefois la pacification des villes ne va pas sans réactions parfois violentes et soudaines de fanatiques irréductibles. — (Michel Droit, De Lattre, maréchal de France, Pierre Horay, éditions de Flore, 1952, p.21)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9de5acfd-ef88-38e3-970d-95895b01a077",
                                        "entry_id": "5c56706a-e729-38e7-a798-eb19250dc42e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apaisement des dissensions, des querelles et des différends entre particuliers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "354e41c3-4a2f-4d01-b85e-afabbce179a5",
                                                "sense_id": "9de5acfd-ef88-38e3-970d-95895b01a077",
                                                "text": "Non seulement il invita ses concitoyens à déposer leurs ressentiments et leurs griefs sur l'autel de la patrie, mais il demanda encore que le bienfait de cette pacification fût étendu aux autres peuples, et que la France, introduisant parmi les nations une nouvelle diplomatie, jetât les fondements d'une alliance universelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3cc4ca6b-50b9-417a-8903-db697fe42f57",
                        "source_entry_id": "c650c1b8-eb09-3687-abbd-10aa467e5d62",
